R("E-DTC-15","e","PHRMA-DTC","Principle 15","DTC advertising should respect the seriousness of the condition and the medicine.",
  "All DTC advertising should respect the seriousness of the health conditions and the medicine being advertised","DTC","judgment",
  J("Does the tone respect the seriousness of the condition and medicine (no trivializing humor, 'hype' framing of risks, lifestyle-only framing)?","Tone proportionate to seriousness.","Trivializes disease or risks."),"low",
  link=dict(re=r"(?i)hype|overhyped|minimiz.*serious")),
